  }, {
    "element_id" : "e000015",
    "element_type" : "text_block",
    "page_number" : 1,
    "bounding_box" : null,
    "text" : "Metals form **giant metallic lattices **in which the metal ions are surrounded by a ‘sea’ of **delocalised **electrons",
    "reading_order" : 15,
    "confidence" : 1.0,
    "role" : "list_item",
    "heading_level" : null,
    "source_engine" : "sme-revision-note",
    "source_engine_version" : "1.0.0"
  }, {
    "element_id" : "e000016",
    "element_type" : "text_block",
    "page_number" : 1,
    "bounding_box" : null,
    "text" : "The metal ions are often packed in **hexagonal layers **or in a **cubic arrangement**",
    "reading_order" : 16,
    "confidence" : 1.0,
    "role" : "list_item",
    "heading_level" : null,
    "source_engine" : "sme-revision-note",
    "source_engine_version" : "1.0.0"
  }, {
    "element_id" : "e000017",
    "element_type" : "text_block",
    "page_number" : 1,
    "bounding_box" : null,
    "text" : "This layered structure with the delocalised electrons gives a metal its key properties",
    "reading_order" : 17,
    "confidence" : 1.0,
    "role" : "list_item",
    "heading_level" : null,
    "source_engine" : "sme-revision-note",
    "source_engine_version" : "1.0.0"
  }, {
    "element_id" : "e000019",
    "element_type" : "text_block",
    "page_number" : 1,
    "bounding_box" : null,
    "text" : "***Layers of copper ions (the delocalised electrons are not shown in the diagram)***",
    "reading_order" : 19,
    "confidence" : 1.0,
    "role" : "paragraph",
    "heading_level" : null,
    "source_engine" : "sme-revision-note",
    "source_engine_version" : "1.0.0"
  }, {
    "element_id" : "e000020",
    "element_type" : "text_block",
    "page_number" : 1,
    "bounding_box" : null,
    "text" : "If other atoms are added to the metal structure, such as carbon atoms, this creates an **alloy**",
    "reading_order" : 20,
    "confidence" : 1.0,
    "role" : "list_item",
    "heading_level" : null,
    "source_engine" : "sme-revision-note",
    "source_engine_version" : "1.0.0"
  }, {
    "element_id" : "e000021",
    "element_type" : "text_block",
    "page_number" : 1,
    "bounding_box" : null,
    "text" : "Alloys are much stronger than pure metals, because the other atoms stop the layers of metal ions sliding over each other easily",
    "reading_order" : 21,
    "confidence" : 1.0,
    "role" : "list_item",
    "heading_level" : null,
    "source_engine" : "sme-revision-note",
    "source_engine_version" : "1.0.0"
  }, {
    "element_id" : "e000022",
    "element_type" : "text_block",
    "page_number" : 1,
    "bounding_box" : null,
    "text" : "The **strength** of the metallic attraction can be increased by:",
    "reading_order" : 22,
    "confidence" : 1.0,
    "role" : "list_item",
    "heading_level" : null,
    "source_engine" : "sme-revision-note",
    "source_engine_version" : "1.0.0"
  }, {
    "element_id" : "e000023",
    "element_type" : "text_block",
    "page_number" : 1,
    "bounding_box" : null,
    "text" : "**Increasing** the number of **delocalised** **electrons** per metal atom",
    "reading_order" : 23,
    "confidence" : 1.0,
    "role" : "list_item",
    "heading_level" : null,
    "source_engine" : "sme-revision-note",
    "source_engine_version" : "1.0.0"
  }, {
    "element_id" : "e000024",
    "element_type" : "text_block",
    "page_number" : 1,
    "bounding_box" : null,
    "text" : "**Increasing** the **positive** **charges** on the metal centres in the lattice",
    "reading_order" : 24,
    "confidence" : 1.0,
    "role" : "list_item",
    "heading_level" : null,
    "source_engine" : "sme-revision-note",
    "source_engine_version" : "1.0.0"
  }, {
    "element_id" : "e000025",
    "element_type" : "text_block",
    "page_number" : 1,
    "bounding_box" : null,
    "text" : "**Decreasing** the **size** of the metal ions",
    "reading_order" : 25,
    "confidence" : 1.0,
    "role" : "list_item",
    "heading_level" : null,
    "source_engine" : "sme-revision-note",
    "source_engine_version" : "1.0.0"
  }, {
    "element_id" : "e000026",
    "element_type" : "text_block",
    "page_number" : 1,
    "bounding_box" : null,
